@startuml
title Smart Machine Health Monitoring System

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #315A87
skinparam componentBorderColor #7F9DB9
skinparam databaseBorderColor #7F9DB9

component "ESP32 + LSM6DS3\n<<Edge Device>>\nCollects vibration data\nPublishes JSON" as Edge

queue "Mosquitto\n<<MQTT Broker>>\nReceives sensor data\nForwards messages" as Broker

component "Python ML Bridge\n<<Processing>>\nFeature extraction\nIsolation Forest scoring\nHealth-index calculation" as ML

database "InfluxDB\n<<Time-Series Database>>\nStores vibration data\nStores health score" as DB

component "Grafana\n<<Dashboard>>\nHealth gauge\nTime-series charts" as Grafana

Edge --> Broker : MQTT publish
Broker --> ML : MQTT subscribe
ML --> DB : write data
DB --> Grafana : query data

note bottom
  The project is an educational prototype using recorded or sensor-generated data.
  The Python bridge performs the processing; it is not a separate production service.
end note
@enduml
